{
  spec: "[TSON-SCHEMA] §5.6, §9 (`numeric.integer_size`)"
  description: "A width of three billion bits loads and reads: a value of sixty digits is inside the signed width, and 42 inside the unsigned one. The width's range is never built; membership is the value's bit length."
  valid: _
}
